// Resources attached to the executable.
//
// The screen saver picker, Explorer and the task bar all take their picture from
// here.  The eye is procedural, so `tools/make_icon.py` renders it once and
// writes `app.ico` with every size Windows asks for.
//
// Resource id 1 is deliberate: the shell picks the lowest-numbered icon group.
1 ICON "app.ico"

// Application manifest (RT_MANIFEST = 24).  This is what makes the settings
// dialog render with the modern control theme instead of the Windows 95 one --
// see the comment inside the manifest.
1 24 "app.manifest"
